    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Backline Commander</h2><p><em>You don’t need to be closest to steer the fight.</em></p><hr><h3>Rules</h3><p>As a Bonus action, choose one ally who can see or hear you within 6 squares That ally may immediately move up to 2 squares without provoking reaction strikes.</p><p>You can use this principle a number of times equal to your skill rank bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Sanctuary.</p>",
